Eclipse by Ilia Reingold (ShaderDesk)
https://github.com/ilrein/shaderdesk/blob/main/Scenes/Eclipse.metal
(Scenes/Eclipse.metal in the Shaderdesk repository, https://github.com/ilrein/shaderdesk;
 ported from commit 6fe4a3b4, "Eclipse: total solar eclipse with a streaming corona,
 prominences, earthshine and a diamond ring", 2026-09-30; the licence below was read at
 the repository head 7e1e051f, 2026-10-21.)

Where the licence is stated
---------------------------
Eclipse.metal carries no licence line of its own. It was written for the Shaderdesk
repository, whose LICENSE file (unchanged since the initial commit) covers the whole
repository, and whose README closes with:

    ## License

    MIT, see [LICENSE](LICENSE).

The LICENSE file, https://github.com/ilrein/shaderdesk/blob/main/LICENSE, reads:

    MIT License

    Copyright (c) 2026 Ilia Reingold

    Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy
    of this software and associated documentation files (the "Software"), to deal
